name: maskclose-up2
---
A dark, opulent portrait of a sultry, inscrutable femme fatale wearing an elaborate, decadent black Venetian masquerade mask that obscures her eyes. Extreme chiaroscuro lighting, reminiscent of Caravaggio and Rembrandt, sculpting every contour of her face with deep, velvety shadows and brilliant, wet highlights on her skin. She is draped in heavy, jeweled black velvet and antique lace, adorned with baroque gold jewelry and blood-red accents. Hyper-detailed, cinematic, ultra-photorealistic, shot on Hasselblad, 85mm lens, extreme shallow depth of field, dramatic volumetric haze, moody high-contrast, rich textures, Greg Rutkowski influence, masterpiece, award-winning editorial fashion photography.